  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>To calculate the mass percent of &#39;&#39;X&#39;&#39; in the solution, we need to determine the mass of &#39;&#39;X&#39;&#39; and the total mass of the solution.</p><p>Given:</p><p>:Solute (<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></math>) = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math></p><p>Solvent (<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math>)<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mole</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math></p><p>Total mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math></p><p>&nbsp;Mass percent of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>18</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p>",
